<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In my spirit He regenerated me,</l><l>In my soul He’s now transforming me.</l><l>He will change my body like unto His own,</l><l>Wholly making me the same as He.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now in life and nature He is one with me</l><l>Then in Him, the glory, I will be;</l><l>I’ll enjoy His presence for eternity</l><l>With Him in complete conformity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
